  region: string;
  status: 'detect'|'contain'|'remediate'|'verify';
  slaMs: number;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate containment under bursty traffic?
- What metrics would you expose to prove recurrence remains zero?

## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates practical CAPA thinking for data quality issues in streaming workloads, focusing on deduplication, regional containment, and fail-safes.

## Key Concepts

- CAPA data model
- Lifecycle state machine
- Evidence linkage
- Canary-based remediation
- Region-based metrics

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal Express API to create CAPA
const express = require('express');
const app = express();
app.use(express.json());
let capas = [];

app.post('/capas', (req, res) => {
  const capa = { id: capas.length + 1, ...req.body, status: 'Observed' };
  capas.push(capa);
  res.status(201).json(capa);
});
```
